          "copies/ps656vb4839.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "pencil/ink, one line, strongly slanted cursive; the 9s are written as a narrow closed loop with a long tail running down to the left, the 1 as a bare diagonal. Day 5 plain; month 9 arguable against 1 but the two glyph shapes differ consistently."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
